  "title": "Elevate your developer productivity with Windows Terminal",
  "description": "Developers lose time switching tools to maintain UNIX habits. This session shows how new improvements coming to Windows Terminal support consistent command‑driven workflows so developers can code with reduced context switching. Attendees learn how to create reusable workflows to help build and ship faster using familiar UNIX like workflows.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
